{
  "id": "b2-e12-image-and-fashion",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Image and fashion",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you like to follow fashion?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it for you to look good?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you prefer comfortable or fashionable clothes?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, has your style changed in the last few years?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e12-a1",
            "b2-e12-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people wearing different clothes. Compare the photographs, and say why the people might have chosen to dress in this way.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it for you to dress for the occasion?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e12-b1",
            "b2-e12-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people dealing with clothes. Compare the photographs, and say what the people might enjoy about these activities.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, which activity would you prefer? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can influence the way people dress, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e12-image-and-fashion",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things influence what young people wear?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e12-image-and-fashion",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which has the biggest influence on the way people dress?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about fashion and personal image.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that the clothes you wear show what kind of person you are. How far do you agree?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think it is important to wear a uniform at work?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, why do you think some people spend a lot of money on designer brands?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should the fashion industry do more to protect the environment?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how has fashion changed since your grandparents were young?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e12-image-and-fashion/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
